Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.16,0:00:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I went over to Toru's place\Nfor the first time yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.75,0:00:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooooh! So how'd it go with him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.45,0:00:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't do anything like that, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.33,0:00:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's got like, a massive\NTV mounted to the wall,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.54,0:00:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and loads of spare rooms on the\Nsecond {\i1}and {\i0}third floors of his house...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought he was a poor plebian like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.79,0:00:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry to hear that...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.66,0:00:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.50,0:00:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut it, you rich asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.79,0:00:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,--Wow, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.37,0:00:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,--You wanna order a cake?\N--Wow, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.91,0:00:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I forgot to pre-order one this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.25,0:00:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We should be able to handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.04,0:00:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't take that many pre-orders,\Nso we're not swamped or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.66,0:00:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of cake do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.45,0:00:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, can I get one with\Ntons of whipped cream?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.20,0:00:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.04,0:00:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I invited Yuna-chan over for Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.75,0:01:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll have you, Yuna-chan, Miyamura...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.33,0:01:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, is he gonna be able to come?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.58,0:01:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better invite him over.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.33,0:01:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell, I don't care if you can't make it,\Nbut Miyamura better be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.25,0:01:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you might be\Nsleeping in a manger on Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.16,0:01:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Christmas?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.29,0:01:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll probably be really busy helping\Nout at the shop from the 23rd on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.04,0:01:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, I figured.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.79,0:01:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. But if I get time,\NI'll definitely come over!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.58,0:01:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, you don't have\Nto squeeze in time for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.25,0:01:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we eat dinner,\Nwe're basically done anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.66,0:01:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.83,0:01:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! You're not coming\Nfor Christmas, Miyamura-kun?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.70,0:01:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No, sorry. I already have lots of work\Nwaiting for me at home today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.37,0:01:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not coming for Christmas?!\NPlease come! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.41,0:01:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry, Sota...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.50,0:01:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.58,0:01:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.41,0:01:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.66,0:01:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.20,0:01:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.12,0:01:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You know he's dating {\i1}me{\i0}, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.87,0:01:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.29,0:01:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.58,0:02:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Horimiya"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.95,0:03:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You know how up until recently,\NI had a crush on Hori?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.83,0:03:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How recently?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.16,0:03:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought he gave up on her ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.12,0:03:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And you know how there was\Nthe whole thing with Kono-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.16,0:03:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does he think "we know" this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.20,0:03:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what that\N"whole thing" even was.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.50,0:03:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And Yoshikawa and I are\Ndefinitely more than just friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.58,0:03:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm not gonna start\Ndating her or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.08,0:03:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,--What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.41,0:03:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,--What?\N--What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.29,0:03:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.95,0:03:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,--What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.37,0:03:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,--What?\N--What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.45,0:03:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,--What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.54,0:04:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.62,0:04:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought they were already dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.91,0:04:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,See, I thought that's how you'd react!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.66,0:04:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you thought\N"I thought they were already dating"!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.70,0:04:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop {\i1}thinking{\i0}, you're gonna\Ngive Iura-kun an aneurism!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.54,0:04:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You thought... we thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.33,0:04:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, we're not dating!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.54,0:04:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, okay, but...\Ndon't you have a crush on her?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.25,0:04:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah, I like her!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.87,0:04:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you not embarrassed\Nto admit that out loud?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.50,0:04:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, do you guys think this is weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.79,0:04:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's weird,\NI'm just surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.16,0:04:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But, like, shouldn't you be more\Nconcerned about what {\i1}she {\i0}thinks of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.50,0:04:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,rather than what {\i1}we {\i0}think of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.50,0:04:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If you two are happy with your\Ncurrent relationship, then that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.08,0:04:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not my place to say\Nwhether it's right or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.70,0:04:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.37,0:04:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so cool, Sengoku-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.25,0:04:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Advice sure sounds different when\Nit's coming from a master romancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.91,0:05:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,When was I ever a "master romancer"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.87,0:05:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, there you are, Toru!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.58,0:05:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Hitherto, and Forevermore"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.58,0:05:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I come by your place\Nto play video games today?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.00,0:05:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Hitherto, and Forevermore"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.00,0:05:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna finish the game we started before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.33,0:05:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Hitherto, and Forevermore"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.33,0:05:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You do? Yeah, sure, you can come over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.95,0:05:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You do? Yeah, sure, you can come over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.29,0:05:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, no, not today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.41,0:05:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, why? You have plans already?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.41,0:05:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't have plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.50,0:05:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's something else...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.70,0:05:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's fine. You can come over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.16,0:05:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? It's fine if\Ntoday's not a good day!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.20,0:05:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's fine. It was gonna\Nhappen sooner or later...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.62,0:05:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sheesh, I never get used\Nto how huge your house is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.54,0:05:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.58,0:05:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you being so quiet?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.12,0:05:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Yoshikawa,\Nlet's get upstairs. C'mon, c'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.45,0:05:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.33,0:05:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, c'moooon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.29,0:06:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, why is this hallway so long?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.08,0:06:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, maybe his mom or dad are home...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.87,0:06:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And he doesn't want me to meet them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.70,0:06:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to rush you, Yoshikawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.83,0:06:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's my fault.\NI wish I were a hot guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.45,0:06:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Wait, why?!\NWhat are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.45,0:06:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, if I were, you wouldn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.08,0:06:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait, why are you locking the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.66,0:06:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.54,0:06:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Why are you loosening your tie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.87,0:06:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.08,0:06:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I always take\Nmy tie off when I get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.00,0:06:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshikawa--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.91,0:06:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.20,0:06:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.33,0:06:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna try anything weird with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.41,0:06:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't want you to\Nbe uncomfortable in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.87,0:06:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what I did wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.95,0:07:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I-It's not your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.54,0:07:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not uncomfortable\Nor scared or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.41,0:07:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.50,0:07:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.33,0:07:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.25,0:07:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Toru-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.79,0:07:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, I forgot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.79,0:07:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,--Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.58,0:07:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,--That's weird. Why are you\Nclosing the door on me?\N--Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.12,0:07:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,--That's weird. Why are you\Nclosing the door on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.00,0:07:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have a friend over?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.95,0:07:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Yeah, I do! Don't barge in!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.95,0:07:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, is that your mom? Is she your mom?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.45,0:07:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, then let me get you two some drinks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.54,0:07:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No thanks! We're good! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.04,0:07:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,She's blocking it with her foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.95,0:07:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Come now, don't be rude to your guest!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.75,0:07:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can leave if I shouldn't be here, Toru!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.70,0:07:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you're good!\NStay right there, Yoshikawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.20,0:07:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.20,0:07:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So her name's Yoshikawa-san, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.54,0:07:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you like cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.33,0:07:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.04,0:08:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go get you some.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.54,0:08:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, we're good!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.75,0:08:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,--But she's our guest!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.91,0:08:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,--Wh-Who is she?\N--But she's our guest!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.41,0:08:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,--And holy crap, she's tall!\N--But she's our guest!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.08,0:08:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Yashiro: 176 cm" "Ishikawa: 174 cm"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.08,0:08:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,--And holy crap, she's tall!\N--But she's our guest!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.70,0:08:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Yashiro: 176 cm" "Ishikawa: 174 cm"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.70,0:08:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,--And holy crap, she's tall!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.58,0:08:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,--And holy crap, she's tall!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.08,0:08:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go get that for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.25,0:08:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.66,0:08:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't barge in without knocking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.58,0:08:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't you gonna go get us some cake?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.50,0:08:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay. You're so impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.04,0:08:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.08,0:08:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank God she's not. That's Yashiro-san.\NShe helps out around the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.41,0:08:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,She always bombards me\Nwith questions about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.79,0:08:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,--Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.37,0:08:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,--Like, "Who were you walking\Nwith the other day?"\N--Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.95,0:08:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,--Like, "Who were you walking\Nwith the other day?"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.50,0:08:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,"Who's that girl you're\Nalways inviting over?"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.83,0:08:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She's such a weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.58,0:08:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.20,0:08:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to knock!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.91,0:08:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, c'mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.91,0:08:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Which would you like,\Nshortcake or cheesecake?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.62,0:08:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Short... no, cheesecake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.66,0:09:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Toru-kun, try anything funny,\Nand I'll tell your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.87,0:09:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna {\i1}try {\i0}anything now\Nthat I know {\i1}you're {\i0}here, Yashiro-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.54,0:09:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Holler if you need anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.58,0:09:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.62,0:09:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.75,0:09:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She's all excited 'cause\NI brought a girl over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.70,0:09:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,She's nice, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.16,0:09:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.62,0:09:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna {\i1}try {\i0}anything now\Nthat I know {\i1}you're {\i0}here, Yashiro-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.66,0:09:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"spin spin spin"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.66,0:09:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna {\i1}try {\i0}anything now\Nthat I know {\i1}you're {\i0}here, Yashiro-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.04,0:09:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"spin spin spin"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.04,0:09:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,S-So if she {\i1}wasn't {\i0}here,\Nhe {\i1}would {\i0}have t-t-t-t--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.95,0:09:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"spin spin spin"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.95,0:09:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshikawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.16,0:09:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshikawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.70,0:09:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?! Something's\Nsetting you off again!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.70,0:09:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.75,0:09:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,N-Nothing's up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.50,0:09:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Don't just stare at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.95,0:09:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"rub rub rub"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.50,0:09:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You're here to play video games, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.00,0:10:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.16,0:10:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna beat it today!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.70,0:10:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it plugged in, Toru!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.70,0:10:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy with the way things are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.08,0:10:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The cakes from this bakery\Nare great! Please, dig in!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.00,0:10:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Iori Bakery"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.00,0:10:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The cakes from this bakery\Nare great! Please, dig in!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.75,0:10:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Iori Bakery"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.75,0:10:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is from Miyamura's shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.66,0:10:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Iori Bakery"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.00,0:10:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Student Council Room"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.54,0:10:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sengoku-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.37,0:10:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"JUMP"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.37,0:10:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sengoku-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.37,0:10:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sengoku-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.54,0:10:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Remi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.87,0:10:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.25,0:10:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell, dude?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.70,0:10:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.41,0:10:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.12,0:10:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You're coming over on Christmas, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.08,0:10:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.20,0:10:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,--On Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.12,0:10:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,--Huh?\N--On Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.58,0:10:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,--Huh?\N--You're coming over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.12,0:10:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,--Sen--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.70,0:10:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,--Huh?\N--Sen--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.41,0:10:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you come over to my place?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.04,0:10:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna hang in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.25,0:10:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No, thanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.29,0:11:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, Sengoku!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.16,0:11:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You made her cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.58,0:11:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay, Remi-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.37,0:11:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That must've been shocking to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.91,0:11:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Get 'im, Miyamura!\NKnock some damn sense into him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.79,0:11:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.95,0:11:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Still traumatized"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.95,0:11:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.66,0:11:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.87,0:11:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, let's hear {\i1}why{\i0}\Nhe doesn't want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.87,0:11:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys have no idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.75,0:11:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If you knew what it was like,\Nyou'd understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.29,0:11:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even wanna talk\Nabout it, but here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.37,0:11:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.25,0:11:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"INSECTS GALORE!"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.29,0:11:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,--The mantis! The mantis\Nis gonna stare at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.20,0:11:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,--Th-They're not mine! They're\Nmy Dad's! I'll take them down!\N--The mantis! The mantis\Nis gonna stare at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.33,0:11:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The... mantis?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.79,0:11:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You had your end-of-semester assembly\Ntoday, right? Did you get your grades?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.20,0:11:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Kyoko Hori Semester Report Card"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.29,0:11:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow, look! She's got A's\Nin everything except Art and P.E.!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.66,0:11:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyoko's a smarty-pants like her dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.91,0:12:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I really hate to agree with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.41,0:12:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,but yes, I suppose she does\Ntake after you in math.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.62,0:12:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the weird preface?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.20,0:12:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is such an emotional moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.04,0:12:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,--Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.79,0:12:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,--Hey, Yuri-chan, I asked you a question.\N--Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.58,0:12:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,--Hey, Yuri-chan, I asked you a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.50,0:12:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The next time you get your grades,\Nyou'll be graduating!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.95,0:12:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,--You failed tons of tests at\Nthe start of your senior year.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.50,0:12:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,--Oh, right.\N--You failed tons of tests at\Nthe start of your senior year.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.41,0:12:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,--Starting this April, I won't be\Nin high school anymore.\N--You failed tons of tests at\Nthe start of your senior year.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.25,0:12:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,--Starting this April, I won't be\Nin high school anymore.\N--Your memory for petty details\Nis one thing I really dislike about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.58,0:12:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at mine, sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.25,0:12:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, great job!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.54,0:12:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what I'll be doing\Naround this time next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.12,0:12:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,After I graduate...\Nwhat will my life be like?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.16,0:12:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, sis, are you looking?\NLook at my grades!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.16,0:12:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,--Wait, you just said we were both\Ngood at math! Are you even listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.25,0:12:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,--Are you listening to me?\N--Wait, you just said we were both\Ngood at math! Are you even listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.33,0:12:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.29,0:12:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.66,0:13:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a huge Christmas tree...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.33,0:13:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch where you're going,\Nor you'll trip and fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.58,0:13:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're Yoshikawa-san's older sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.62,0:13:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not wearing your glasses today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.33,0:13:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I actually just got contacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.95,0:13:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, nice. I should think\Nabout getting contacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.54,0:13:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like me to buy you some?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.62,0:13:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.91,0:13:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Today is Christmas after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.00,0:13:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a little weird for a high-school kid\Nto buy a college student contacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.50,0:13:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wearing a suit today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.29,0:13:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm interviewing for jobs. It sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.12,0:13:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, my dumbass sister\Nspends all her time screwing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.70,0:13:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You can laugh.\NIt's funny because it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.37,0:13:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, laugh. She's dumber\Nthan a bag of rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.00,0:14:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, I meant...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.87,0:14:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.37,0:14:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Want me to go buy some dessert?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.95,0:14:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.08,0:14:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way, dude!\NHow am I supposed to watch TV?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.37,0:14:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell kind of tone is that?! I don't\Ncare if you're my brother, you're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.29,0:14:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And put your gross tissues\Nin the trash can, you dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.70,0:14:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I did! Kiko keeps taking them out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.12,0:14:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.58,0:14:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, now it's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.45,0:14:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your germs away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.62,0:14:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"High School Exam Kanji"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.62,0:14:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Middle School Math Review"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.04,0:14:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, Moto, time for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.83,0:14:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.00,0:14:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, look at all this food!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.16,0:14:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sengoku-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.58,0:15:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Come now, the bugs aren't {\i1}that {\i0}bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.33,0:15:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're meeting Remi at\Nseven, right? It's 6:30 now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.70,0:15:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You spending Christmas\Nby yourself, Sakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.29,0:15:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I do that every year! I'm Buddhist!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.58,0:15:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.04,0:15:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.25,0:15:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"SLUMP"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.25,0:15:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to eat dinner after\Ncoming face-to-face with those bugs?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.91,0:15:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to eat dinner after\Ncoming face-to-face with those bugs?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.79,0:15:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not eating dinner with the bugs.\NYou're eating dinner with Remi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.00,0:15:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll repeat a year and stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.62,0:15:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and graduate already, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.08,0:15:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Really wish I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.41,0:15:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me. Just one year.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.29,0:16:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a year, mmkay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.54,0:16:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.70,0:16:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura's {\i1}busy{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.54,0:16:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So? It's your job to\Nbring 'im over here anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.62,0:16:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And what, ruin their Christmas sales?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.83,0:16:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's gonna come\Ndrop off our cake, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.41,0:16:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.58,0:16:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think he'll come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.95,0:16:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I dunno, he'll probably\Nstay at the front door.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.37,0:16:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Aww, that's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.33,0:16:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm not sad about it, if you're worried!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.87,0:16:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We're {\i1}all {\i0}sad about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.79,0:16:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Miyamura belongs to everyone."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.41,0:16:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, Kyoko?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.91,0:16:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.87,0:16:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"New text from: Miyamura"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.70,0:16:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"New text from: Miyamura"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.70,0:16:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's from Miyamura!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.12,0:16:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's from Miyamura!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.29,0:16:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay, Miyamura-kun's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.29,0:16:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.83,0:16:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's play cards, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.54,0:16:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.87,0:16:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I can't stay at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.54,0:16:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, your hands are freezing!\NGet in here and warm up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.70,0:16:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get you a warm drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.25,0:16:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okay, but I have to\Nleave right after I drink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.79,0:17:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay! Let's play Old Maid!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.91,0:17:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a whole lot\Ndifferent from last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.08,0:17:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"One Hour Later"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.83,0:17:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Exhausted"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.20,0:17:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Exhausted"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.20,0:17:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I, uh... {\i1}really {\i0}have to go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.83,0:17:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I, uh... {\i1}really {\i0}have to go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.12,0:17:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Aww!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.41,0:17:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't "aww" him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.54,0:17:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.95,0:17:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll walk him home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.12,0:17:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No following!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.66,0:17:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to. It's so cold out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.25,0:17:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.91,0:17:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not {\i1}that {\i0}cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.58,0:17:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so quiet with all the snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.41,0:17:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san's gone quiet, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.08,0:17:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We're graduating soon, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.04,0:17:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon? We've got a while, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.91,0:17:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.41,0:18:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I still don't know that\Nmuch about you, Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.62,0:18:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's tons I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.58,0:18:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.33,0:18:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know very much about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.58,0:18:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.87,0:18:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.66,0:18:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,e-even {\i1}after {\i0}we graduate!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.00,0:18:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I mean, if that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.33,0:18:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,P-Please say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.50,0:18:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.41,0:18:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get married!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.41,0:19:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.04,0:19:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.45,0:19:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.08,0:19:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.95,0:19:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I {\i1}said{\i0}, I'll make you happy, Miyamura!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.08,0:19:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't the {\i1}guy {\i0}supposed\Nto say that to the {\i1}girl{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.04,0:19:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make sense that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.45,0:19:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm self-centered, and all\NI'm good at is studying and chores!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.50,0:19:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"crunch crunch"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.50,0:19:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm self-centered, and all\NI'm good at is studying and chores!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.66,0:19:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"crunch crunch"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.66,0:19:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not nice to people, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.91,0:19:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"crunch crunch"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.91,0:19:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.75,0:19:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.29,0:19:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So you can't be the one saying it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.00,0:19:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think that's\Nhow it works, but okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.95,0:19:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I look forward to our future together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.08,0:19:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.37,0:19:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"JUMP"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.50,0:20:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Right! Right! I'm coming--
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.58,0:20:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I gotta head back to the shop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.50,0:20:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure, good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.08,0:20:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm freezing! I better get home, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.08,0:20:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My face is all hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.58,0:22:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Next Time: I Would Gift You the Sky"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.33,0:22:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you go to the shrine\Non New Year's every year?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.50,0:22:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I try to. How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.25,0:22:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Only when it gets less crowded.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.29,0:22:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna go together this year?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.20,0:22:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"shake shake"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.45,0:22:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Fortune"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.62,0:22:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What's yours say?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.16,0:22:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,"Keep calm and carry on," basically.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.95,0:22:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.00,0:22:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, as long as you keep smiling,\NI don't need much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.66,0:22:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that? I couldn't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.58,0:22:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.41,0:22:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.25,0:22:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.20,0:22:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy as long as you're smiling, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.00,0:22:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So you {\i1}did {\i0}hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.70,0:22:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.45,0:22:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Amazake"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.91,0:22:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's kind of weird, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.58,0:23:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the last person I see this year,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.33,0:23:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and the first person I see next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.54,0:23:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.50,0:23:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope it'll be like that\Nevery year from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.87,0:23:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.45,0:23:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Will we be together forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.20,0:23:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup, together forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.45,0:23:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Forever.
